                            "clipping"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf6952e1-ce04-4cbb-8778-e3601f3b3693",
                                "sense_id": "ee084043-0716-306c-8a23-f498ad1ac88d",
                                "text": "Pics from outside of Survivor, vidcaps, bios, descriptions (how friggin' TALL are these guys, exactly?)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5a6f08f5-4a8c-377e-bf1c-71bde6840947",
                        "entry_id": "00d7dc37-8546-3102-9763-3bdad803c235",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A short section of a user profile that contains information about the user, especially one which can be customised; the about me section."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9384854-3704-463d-b92f-0e024d55a586",
                                "sense_id": "5a6f08f5-4a8c-377e-bf1c-71bde6840947",
                                "text": "To find more about her, check out her bio on Instagram."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7bcefec-cd46-42f2-b453-c14a34ef0506",
                                "sense_id": "5a6f08f5-4a8c-377e-bf1c-71bde6840947",
                                "text": "Gendercrits are now putting dinosaur emoji in their bios 🦕🦖, presumably to illustrate that their views are extinct relics of the past."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0fe2f9d3-9042-45e6-b862-0212ca20e5c4",
                                "sense_id": "5a6f08f5-4a8c-377e-bf1c-71bde6840947",
                                "text": "She doesn’t position herself as a biblical scholar or a prophet. She’s a humble “wifey & mommy,” according to her Instagram bio—even if her 2019 wedding did garner almost 2.5 million views on YouTube."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "981f7994-c615-3a0a-becd-28a0ca26e413",
                        "entry_id": "00d7dc37-8546-3102-9763-3bdad803c235",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A biographical sketch."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "092de52b-4923-3304-b53a-cffab425e8c3",
                        "entry_id": "00d7dc37-8546-3102-9763-3bdad803c235",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clipping of biology."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "clipping",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8a0fe04-25e3-481a-9207-f60a577897ef",
                                "sense_id": "092de52b-4923-3304-b53a-cffab425e8c3",
                                "text": "I've got a bio exam in the morning."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "99c771b0-3dd3-4695-ad9a-424bf30d1d2f",
                                "sense_id": "092de52b-4923-3304-b53a-cffab425e8c3",
                                "text": "It boils down to science. Biology, chemistry and physics. I used to hate bio and chem. Now they fascinate me because I’ve realised they make up the world around us as well as us."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b0228dba-fe27-3b29-ab33-0f1b0cdc8417",
                        "entry_id": "00d7dc37-8546-3102-9763-3bdad803c235",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clipping of bioscope (“cinema”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "South-Africa",
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "clipping",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa9b0466-bfd0-4ec4-b780-ad5b792184db",
                                "sense_id": "b0228dba-fe27-3b29-ab33-0f1b0cdc8417",
                                "text": "Sometimes Estelle had to help her mother on Saturdays and Irwin went to classes for ultra-brainy children, but Alan and I always went to the bio."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
